# The people vouched for in datekit, and anyone denounced.
#
# A vouch lets a person claim an ask; anyone not denounced may post in the
# discussions. A maintainer adds a line by landing it.
#
# One handle per line, without @, in alphabetical order. A `platform:`
# prefix names a handle somewhere else, a leading minus denounces, and
# whatever follows the handle after a space is a note.
